{"comment": "A URI is echoed exactly as the client sent it for a document it opened or named, and a URI it never sent comes in the canonical form (LSP-01's decision, plan §2.3). The stub server answers textDocument/definition with three locations: the position asked about, in the document named; the start of Opened.java beside it, which the client opened; the start of Other.java beside it, which the client never named. The daemon writes each canonically (a%2Bb, c%40d)."}
{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/didOpen", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "file:///work/a+b/c@d/Opened.java", "languageId": "java", "version": 1, "text": "class Opened {}\n"}}}}
{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "textDocument/definition", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "file:///work/a+b/c@d/Main.java"}, "position": {"line": 3, "character": 7}}}}
{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "two", "method": "textDocument/definition", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "file:///work/a%2Bb/c%40d/Main.java"}, "position": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}}
{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "textDocument/definition", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "https://example.com/Main.java"}, "position": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}}
{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "textDocument/definition", "params": {"textDocument": {}}}}
{"expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": [{"uri": "file:///work/a+b/c@d/Main.java", "range": {"start": {"line": 3, "character": 7}, "end": {"line": 3, "character": 7}}}, {"uri": "file:///work/a+b/c@d/Opened.java", "range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}, {"uri": "file:///work/a%2Bb/c%40d/Other.java", "range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}]}}
{"expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "two", "result": [{"uri": "file:///work/a%2Bb/c%40d/Main.java", "range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}, {"uri": "file:///work/a+b/c@d/Opened.java", "range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}, {"uri": "file:///work/a%2Bb/c%40d/Other.java", "range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 0}}}]}}
{"expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "error": {"code": -32602, "message": "<any>"}}}
